# nanoC Lexical Analyzer

## Description
This is a **Lexical Analyzer** for **nanoC**, implemented using **Flex**.  
It scans an input `nanoC` source file (`.nc`) and generates:
1. `tokens.txt` - List of all tokens identified.
2. `symbol_table.txt` - List of identifiers, keywords, and literals.

## Installation & Running

### 1️⃣ Compile the Lexical Analyzer
open linux terminal from same directory where code is present ,No enter following line of commands to execute 

to run iterative ---->
make
./a6it <input_file>

to run non-iterative  ---->
make
./a6nit <input_file>


eg:-
make
./a6it test.nc